Directory: widget/
Product:   Lovense Cam OBS widget ("Lovense Video Feedback" / OBS Toolset)
Version:   2.5.6
Owner:     Lovense (https://www.lovense.com)
License:   proprietary, not MIT

The files in widget/ are redistributed unchanged so that phonecam can serve
the widget locally and work offline. They are the property of Lovense and are
not covered by the MIT license that applies to the rest of this project.

The files were extracted from the official installer
Lovense_OBS_Toolset_x64.exe, published by Lovense at:

  https://www.lovense.com/files/apps/cam/obs/Lovense_OBS_Toolset_x64.exe

If you redistribute this repository, keep this notice. If you do not want to
ship proprietary files, delete widget/ and use:

  phonecam lovense setup --download

which extracts the widget from the official installer at runtime.

The Lovense Cam browser extension itself is NOT bundled. It is downloaded
from https://www.lovense.com/files/apps/cam/lovense_cam.zip and patched
locally by `phonecam lovense extension`.
